ltiples of $10.$\n\nTherefore, the complement of $A$ is\n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{A}={-75,-65,-55,…,25}.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071504/state.json" "file_sha256" "12749d077dc896c1b68da4c3a284382550d042f5617f4a8bfe2d56f01254efa3"} {"question" "q-81206" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071504/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "f9e67c0752d98cbf07cc791a98fe64ee643774ef2741af6b019ff52a888f3dc2"} {"question" "q-81206" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071504/state.json" "file_sha256" "12749d077dc896c1b68da4c3a284382550d042f5617f4a8bfe2d56f01254efa3"} {"question" "q-81206" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "{-75,-60,-45,…,25}"] ["math" "{-75,-65,-55,…,25}"] ["math" "{-75,-65,-55,…,30}"] ["math" "{-75,-65,-55,…,35}"] ["math" "{-75,-70,-65,…,25}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071504/state.json" "file_sha256" "12749d077dc896c1b68da4c3a284382550d042f5617f4a8bfe2d56f01254efa3"} {"question" "q-81206" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "{-75,-65,-55,…,25}"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071504/state.json" "file_sha256" "12749d077dc896c1b68da4c3a284382550d042f5617f4a8bfe2d56f01254efa3"} {"question" "q-105188" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "Let $U={a,b,c,…,z}$ be the universal set and $Y={a,b,c,…,j}$, then $\\overset{―}{Y}=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071504/state.json" "file_sha256" "12749d077dc896c1b68da4c3a284382550d042f5617f4a8bfe2d56f01254efa3"} {"question" "q-105188" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The complement of $Y,$ denoted $\\overset{―}{Y},$ consists of every element in the universal set $U$ that is not in the set $Y.$\n\nThe universal set $U$ consists of the letters $a$ through $z,$ while the set $Y$ consists of the letters $a$ through $j.$\n\nSo, the only elements of $U$ that are not in $Y$ are the letters $k$ through $z.$\n\nTherefore, the complement of $Y$ is\n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{Y}={k,l,m,…,z}.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071504/state.json" "file_sha256" "12749d077dc896c1b68da4c3a284382550d042f5617f4a8bfe2d56f01254efa3"} {"question" "q-105188" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071504/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "f9e67c0752d98cbf07cc791a98fe64ee643774ef2741af6b019ff52a888f3dc2"} {"question" "q-105188" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071504/state.json" "file_sha256" "12749d077dc896c1b68da4c3a284382550d042f5617f4a8bfe2d56f01254efa3"} {"question" "q-105188" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "{i,j,k,…,z}"] ["math" "{j,k,l…,z}"] ["math" "{k,l,m,…,z}"] ["math" "{l,m,n…,z}"] ["math" "{m,n,o…,z}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071504/state.json" "file_sha256" "12749d077dc896c1b68da4c3a284382550d042f5617f4a8bfe2d56f01254efa3"} {"question" "q-105188" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "{k,l,m,…,z}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071504/state.json" "file_sha256" "12749d077dc896c1b68da4c3a284382550d042f5617f4a8bfe2d56f01254efa3"} {"question" "q-105178" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "If $U={5,10,15,…,50}$ is the universal set and $C={5,15,25,35,45},$ then the complement of $C$ is" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071504/state.json" "file_sha256" "12749d077dc896c1b68da4c3a284382550d042f5617f4a8bfe2d56f01254efa3"} {"question" "q-105178" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "The complement of $C,$ denoted $\\overset{―}{C},$ consists of every element in the universal set $U$ that is not in the set $C.$\n\nThe elements of $U$ that are not in $C$ are $10,20,30,40,$ and $50.$\n\nTherefore, the complement of $C$ is\n\n$$\n\\overset{―}{C}={10,20,30,40,50}.\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071504/state.json" "file_sha256" "12749d077dc896c1b68da4c3a284382550d042f5617f4a8bfe2d56f01254efa3"} {"question" "q-105178" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071504/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "f9e67c0752d98cbf07cc791a98fe64ee643774ef2741af6b019ff52a888f3dc2"} {"question" "q-105178" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071504/state.json" "file_sha256" "12749d077dc896c1b68da4c3a284382550d042f5617f4a8bfe2d56f01254efa3"} {"question" "q-105178" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "{0,10,20,30,40,50}"] ["math" "{10,20,30,40,50}"